Package: kulan-update-center
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: @PUBLISHER@ <@MAINTAINER_EMAIL@>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: kulan-base (= @VERSION@), python3 (>= 3.11), pkexec, apt, timeshift, lynis
Recommends: unattended-upgrades, kulan-settings (= @VERSION@)
Homepage: @HOME_URL@
Description: @NAME@ updates, add-ons and restore points
 Checks for updates and installs updates and add-ons after an admin
 password. Kulan Settings and the top-bar indicator use it.
 .
 Also makes daily restore points with Timeshift, so you can roll back the
 system if an update causes problems.
